Description: Wild OS Voice
 Voice records from the microphone to Opus files in the Recordings folder,
 with pause, markers to jump back to, and a live waveform. Transcripts
 are made on the PC with whisper.cpp (built in): turning them on
 downloads the speech model once from a fixed address and checks its
 SHA-256, and nothing else ever goes online. Markers and transcripts are
 plain files beside each recording. No accounts and no tracking.
